    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6aed0c95961c960694fd94d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "陪伴在我的身旁就意味着，\n您也将一同背负这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbcb73e457a2f364bcf42b769c82b909f20842c8e069bd8bb99c9017df0a6429",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
