    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5ad8f5129f4284980498e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便如此，您依然给予我这般温暖的心意。\n我因此，收获了……多大的帮助啊，",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3dee175ab6ff212c4b41cdf77809e85cb0d4f88560653a41887b96bf568819",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143109.json",
      "json_path": [
